European Commission, Joint Research Centre. Common Waste Gas Management and Treatment Systems in the Chemical Sector, BREF WGC. 2023. [Official reference and full-text access](https://bureau-industrial-transformation.jrc.ec.europa.eu/reference/common-waste-gas-treatment-chemical-sector).

Klaus Daginnus, Thibaut Marty, Nicoletta Valeria Trotta, Thomas Brinkmann, Aidan Whitfield and Serge Roudier. JRC131915, EUR 31393 EN, DOI 10.2760/220326. The reference focuses on chemical-industry emissions to air and their management/treatment.

Read the full general inventory, process-integrated prevention, collection, monitoring and applicable treatment chapters. Evaluate normal and changed conditions, diffuse losses, measured performance and maintenance with an explicit constituent account.

